ELECT TEAM screen: rows top..top+20 of the pool as 1771:2F37 for A927[DS:6D18 + 2*manager + row - 1], then the card of the selected pool player (0791:DDCB, 0791:DE51, 1771:42BC)', 'confidence': 'established', 'basis': 'F011; read decompiled/seg_0791_09.c; read code/seg_0791_22.asm'}, '0791:DC7E': {'address': '0791:DC7E', 'name': 'assistant_recommend_squad', 'purpose': "the assistant's recommended squad of 20 (GOAL.HLP P58, the Ins key of the SELECT TEAM screen): for the manager's country, two passes over the 20 squad slots, and for each slot the whole pool is scanned for a same-position player whose player_strength exceeds the incumbent's, swapped in by u214b_swap_bytes", 'confidence': 'likely', 'basis': 'read named/seg_0791_10.c'}, '0791:E44F': {'address': '0791:E44F', 'name': 'select_team_screen', 'purpose': "the SELECT TEAM screen of the current manager's country: the squad list and the selected player's card (1771:4E22), toggled Left/Right to the pool list (0791:E2E6); Enter swaps the selected squad and pool players (0791:DEA6, when DS:0C1F == 0), R/C/T act on the selected player, and Ins with the squad side up and DS:0C1F == 0 runs the assistant's recommended 20 (0791:DC7E); Esc exits", 'confidence': 'established', 'basis': 'F011; F016; read decompiled/seg_0791_09.c; read code/seg_0791_22.asm'}, '0791:E80D': {'address': '0791:E80D', 'name': 'ask_watch_match', 'purpose': "the watch-this-match prompt for a fixture without a managed team: match set-up 0791:A4A1, shows the template DS:3A36 (its text is 'Do you want to watch this match ?') and loops until Y, N or Esc; then, for both teams with no test of 0B77, reset_team_tactics (0791:BC5D); on N or Esc it writes 0xFE to the fixture's first byte and returns 0, on Y it returns 1; reached through 000E:6C21", 'confidence': 'established', 'basis': 'F010'}, '0791:EA09': {'address': '0791:EA09', 'name': 'first_team_valid', 'purpose': 'checks both managed sides\' first elevens (squad[0..10]): a player_unavailable member while DS:0C1F == 0 marks the side invalid outright, position counts are taken over available players only, and each warning it shows ("X has an ineligible player in the first team", 0791:E9A2; "X has too many / no ...", 0791:E9CE/E9E0, through u214b_message_if_flag 214B:1765) also marks the side invalid; returns 1 only when both sides stayed valid - ED8A\'s \' play \' silently loops while it returns 0 (F016\'s r0002-r0004 stall)', 'confidence': 'likely', 'basis': 'F016; read named/seg_0791_11.c'}, '0791:ED8A': {'address': '0791:ED8A', 'name': 'in_match_menu', 'purpose': "the in-match menu (screen DS:2598), with the left and right side items: 1/6 team tactics (1771:1981; sets DS:9B55 if +0x2D changed), 2/7 and Space 0791:E949, 3/8 0791:E929 (unless DS:0C21), 4/9 the match board 0791:0106, 5/10 leave (confirmed by 0791:EA09); one key toggles [DS:A923]+0x41; the loop exits only when an item set local_3 AND EA09 returns 1, so ' play ' with an invalid first eleven redraws silently and waits again", 'confidence': 'likely', 'basis': 'F005; F006; F010; F016; read decompiled/seg_0791_09.c'}, '0791:F098': {'address': '0791:F098', 'name': 'play_match', 'purpose': "the match proper: 0791:998C, 9955, 9A32; stores the score DS:9B3C in the fixture's word +0 and the result byte +3 (2 draw, else home < away); if DS:7C36 and drawn, extra time (9B0C, 9B5B) and then penalty_shootout; if not quick and the scores differ, 0791:98C4", 'confidence': 'likely', 'basis': 'F005; F009; read decompiled/seg_0791_09.c'}, '0791:F1F6': {'address': '0791:F1F6', 'name': 'run_match', 'purpose': "runs one fixture: set-up 0791:A4A1, the team screen ED8A, saves the screen, copies the players' morale and sets performance 0x37 for slots 1..11, plays 0791:F098 (which reaches the tick loop 97D0), then the summary (0106) and the offer to save the match summary to disk (0B7C with the prompt at F1D4, then save_goal_file 0A6B on yes) when not quick, and the post-match tail: reset_team_tactics (0791:BC5D) for teams with 0B77 zero, then D050, then BA4E per managed side, with CB7D and E929 among the post-match updates", 'confidence': 'established', 'basis': 'F005; F009; F010; read decompiled/seg_0791_09.c'}, '0791:F3F2': {'address': '0791:F3F2', 'name': 'unit_0791_init', 'purpose': "the start-up of unit 0791: sets the screen-buffer pointers DS:7C16/7C26 (from DS:A96A), DS:7C1A (A96E) and DS:7C22 (A972), allocates 4000 zeroed bytes at DS:7C1E (214B:0A62), and stores the BIOS tick count's low word at DS:8336", 'confidence': 'established', 'basis': 'F004; F006; read decompiled/seg_0791_09.c'}, '1771:0021': {'address': '1771:0021', 'name': 'manager_count_menu', 'purpose': 'the new-game menu that sets the number of managers [DS:A923]+0: a 6-item menu, the keys 1..6', 'confidence': 'likely', 'basis': 'F011; read decompiled/seg_1771_01.c; read code/seg_1771_01.asm'}, '1771:027B': {'address': '1771:027B', 'name': 'save_or_load_game', 'purpose': 'saves (mode 0, "Saving game...", 214B:1AD1 writes; a failure clears the result) or loads (mode non-zero, "Loading game...", 214B:1B47 reads) the game\'s 22 blocks: names, countries, players, the state [DS:A923], fixtures and others; closes the file and returns the success flag', 'confidence': 'likely', 'basis': 'F002; F007; read decompiled/seg_1771_01.c'}, '1771:0AA7': {'address': '1771:0AA7', 'name': 'manager_bonus', 'purpose': "the manager's match bonus: the manager byte at [DS:A91F] + 3*(+0x2E) + 1, zero-extended (xor ah,ah at 0AD9, so 0..255 and the idiv never sees a negative dividend), idiv 8, +0x10; 0BC4 adds it to every available player's strength and its /8 to the attack and defence shares", 'confidence': 'established', 'basis': 'F012'}, '1771:0B77': {'address': '1771:0B77', 'name': 'is_managed', 'purpose': 'returns whether the country is managed by a human: its +0x2E > 0x80', 'confidence': 'established', 'basis': 'F007; F008; read decompiled/seg_1771_01.c'}, '1771:0BC4': {'address': '1771:0BC4', 'name': 'compute_team_line_strengths', 'purpose': "(flag, side, country): for squad entries 1..11 with a nonzero squad word it adds the player's strength (377E, plus the 0AA7 manager bonus when nonzero) to DS:9B45 + 2 side + 4 k, line k from the table DS:0D4E[+6] = [0,1,1,4,4,2,2,2,2,5,5,5,3,3,0,1] (k = 0..3 are keeper, defence, midfield and attack; k >= 4 halves the value over lines k-3 and k-2); it acts only on the effective tactic elements 1, 5 and 6 (the set constant 0x62 at 1771:0BA4): the player's effective element e is +0xF element e when e < 5 and +0xF element e+4 is set, else element e of +0x2D of the country in the player's byte 0; each set one adds 0AA7 div 8 to the attack sum and each clear one to the defence sum (9B49 + 2 side), and the flag adds sum/8 (signed) to each of the four sums", 'confidence': 'established', 'basis': 'F010; F012; read decompiled/seg_1771_01.c; read decompiled/seg_1771_02.c'}, '1771:0E24': {'address': '1771:0E24', 'name': 'country_colour', 'purpose': "the colour of a country's name: 0x0F when managed (1771:0B77), else DS:6905[country +0x2C]", 'confidence': 'established', 'basis': 'F008; read decompiled/seg_1771_01.c'}, '1771:0F58': {'address': '1771:0F58', 'name': 'draw_country_name', 'purpose': "writes at (column p1, row p2) 15 dashes (DS:0D6A) in colour DS:0D7A[[DS:A964]], then, unless the country is 0, its name DS:9B68 + 16 n in 1771:0E24's colour", 'confidence': 'likely', 'basis': 'F008; read decompiled/seg_1771_01.c'}, '1771:10E7': {'address': '1771:10E7', 'name': 'country_rating', 'purpose': '((5 - continent) * (0x21 - continent rank) + (0x81 - world rank)) idiv 2 over the country record', 'confidence': 'established', 'basis': 'F007'}, '1771:157D': {'address': '1771:157D', 'name': 'draw_team_panel', 'purpose': "a country's information panel (template DS:4BBE): name, manager, ranks (world_rank, continent_rank, +0x28, +0x29), line counts (1771:0E6C), word bars DS:9B5A..9B60, the 8 team-tactic flags of +0x2D, line strengths (1771:0BC4), continent", 'confidence': 'like